# A binary that changes on every run and tells a reader nothing.
.coverage
htmlcov/
.DS_Store

# THE EXECUTOR CONTRACT IS NOT PART OF THE SOFTWARE. AGENTS.md is written for
# whoever is driving this repository on one machine, and this repository is
# public: a clone is somebody installing a governance engine, not somebody
# taking over its execution. The convention had been stated in a test comment
# and in nothing that could stop a `git add`, and the file was committed anyway
# and stayed for nine commits. A convention held only in prose is kept by
# whoever remembers it.
AGENTS.md
